{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":27.639999389648438,"text":"On the south slope stood the Asclepion, a sanctuary where sick people came. Anyone who recovered left a thank-you gift, and many of them were shaped like the part of the body that had hurt. A marble leg, a hand, a pair of eyes. They are strange and moving at the same time, because each one is a real story about somebody who was frightened and then got better. Others left carved panels showing a whole family walking up to the god.","words":[{"word":"On","start":0,"end":0.4000000059604645},{"word":"the","start":0.4000000059604645,"end":0.6200000047683716},{"word":"south","start":0.6200000047683716,"end":0.8799999952316284},{"word":"slope","start":0.8799999952316284,"end":1.2599999904632568},{"word":"stood","start":1.2599999904632568,"end":1.659999966621399},{"word":"the","start":1.659999966621399,"end":2.119999885559082},{"word":"Asclepion","start":2.119999885559082,"end":2.5},{"word":"a","start":3.119999885559082,"end":3.4000000953674316},{"word":"sanctuary","start":3.4000000953674316,"end":3.619999885559082},{"word":"where","start":3.619999885559082,"end":4.019999980926514},{"word":"sick","start":4.019999980926514,"end":4.239999771118164},{"word":"people","start":4.239999771118164,"end":4.480000019073486},{"word":"came","start":4.480000019073486,"end":4.78000020980835},{"word":"Anyone","start":5.659999847412109,"end":5.78000020980835},{"word":"who","start":5.78000020980835,"end":6.159999847412109},{"word":"recovered","start":6.159999847412109,"end":6.519999980926514},{"word":"left","start":6.519999980926514,"end":6.820000171661377},{"word":"a","start":6.820000171661377,"end":7.099999904632568},{"word":"thank","start":7.099999904632568,"end":7.320000171661377},{"word":"you","start":7.320000171661377,"end":7.360000133514404},{"word":"gift","start":7.360000133514404,"end":7.639999866485596},{"word":"and","start":8.140000343322754,"end":8.300000190734863},{"word":"many","start":8.30000019073